<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="section-padding">
    <div class="container">
        
        <!-- Header Section -->
        <div class="reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 80px;">
            <p class="hero-tagline">• TACTICAL CO-PILOT</p>
            <h1 class="page-main-title">eCommerce & <span class="masked">Marketing Suite</span></h1>
            <div class="page-intro" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center; max-width: 800px;">
                <p>We quietly steer the backend and handle the day-to-day operations so you can scale your luxury brand without the scramble.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Intro Content Block -->
        <section class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 100px;">
            <div class="detailed-service-row" style="border-bottom: none; padding: 0; gap: 80px; align-items: center;">
                <div class="service-info">
                    <h2 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 20px; color: white; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">The Reality of Scaling</h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); margin-bottom: 25px;">
                        Let’s be honest—running an eCommerce brand is no small gig. It’s like running a mini empire (just without the crown). It’s product uploads, campaign launches, SEO checklists, email flows, analytics deep-dives, and answering customer queries before your coffee kicks in.
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--accent-gold); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 25px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">
                        Sound familiar? We’ve got you.
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);">
                        At <strong>Narizari</strong>, we take the pressure off your plate so you can focus on what you actually want to be doing—building your brand, creating magic, and celebrating wins.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-visual" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                    <div class="glass-box" style="padding: 60px 45px; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(166,141,106,0.05) 0%, rgba(37,9,14,0.4) 100%); border-radius: 40px; height: auto; border: 1px solid rgba(166,141,106,0.15); width: 100%;">
                        <span class="option-icon" style="font-size: 56px; display: block; margin-bottom: 20px;">🛡️</span>
                        <h4 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.4; color: white; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">Full-Suite Co-Pilot</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                            Think of us as your eCommerce co-pilot—quietly steering the backend while you take the spotlight.
                        </p>
                        <div style="margin-top: 30px; height: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); width: 100%;"></div>
                        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent-gold); margin-top: 25px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">
                            We handle the scramble, you scale.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 6 Pillars Support Grid -->
        <section class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 120px;">
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px;">
                <span class="section-label">• FULL-SUITE SUPPORT •</span>
                <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 15px;">What Our Support Looks Like</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="services-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px;">
                
                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div class="service-card" style="padding: 45px 35px; border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); height: auto; transition: all 0.4s ease;">
                    <span class="service-no" style="font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.6;">PILLAR 01</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 15px; color: white; line-height: 1.3;">Platform & Catalog Management</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin: 0;">
                        From keeping product listings neat and keyword-rich to syncing inventory across channels—we’ve got your backend organised and running like clockwork. New launch? We’ll make it shine before it even hits the homepage.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div class="service-card" style="padding: 45px 35px; border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); height: auto; transition: all 0.4s ease;">
                    <span class="service-no" style="font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.6;">PILLAR 02</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 15px; color: white; line-height: 1.3;">SEO & Site Optimization</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin: 0;">
                        Visibility is everything. We fine-tune your site so it ranks higher, loads faster, and keeps users engaged longer. From keywords to UX—we don’t just boost traffic, we keep it converting.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div class="service-card" style="padding: 45px 35px; border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); height: auto; transition: all 0.4s ease;">
                    <span class="service-no" style="font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.6;">PILLAR 03</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 15px; color: white; line-height: 1.3;">Performance Marketing & Campaign Execution</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin: 0;">
                        No throwing money into the ad void here. We create campaigns with strategy and style—targeted, creative, and results-driven. Meta, Google, influencers—we know where your audience lives and how to grab their attention.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4 -->
                <div class="service-card" style="padding: 45px 35px; border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); height: auto; transition: all 0.4s ease;">
                    <span class="service-no" style="font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.6;">PILLAR 04</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 15px; color: white; line-height: 1.3;">Social Media & Content Management</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin: 0;">
                        We build scroll-stopping content with a purpose. Your tone, your aesthetic, our strategic edge. Whether it’s reels, captions, or blog posts—we tell your brand story and keep the conversation going.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 5 -->
                <div class="service-card" style="padding: 45px 35px; border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); height: auto; transition: all 0.4s ease;">
                    <span class="service-no" style="font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.6;">PILLAR 05</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 15px; color: white; line-height: 1.3;">Analytics, Reporting & Growth Insights</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin: 0;">
                        No more data overload. We break it all down into what you need to know, why it matters, and what to do next. Simple, smart, and always actionable.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 6 -->
                <div class="service-card" style="padding: 45px 35px; border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); height: auto; transition: all 0.4s ease;">
                    <span class="service-no" style="font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.6;">PILLAR 06</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 15px; color: white; line-height: 1.3;">Customer Experience & Support Advisory</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin: 0;">
                        From the first click to the follow-up email, we help shape customer journeys that leave a lasting impression. We’re here to help turn shoppers into superfans.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA Section -->
        <section class="page-cta reveal">
            <div class="cta-inner" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 80px 40px; border-radius: 40px;">
                <h2>Let’s build something that sells—and sticks.</h2>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 40px; color: var(--text-secondary);">We’re ready when you are. Let us take the day-to-day scramble off your plate.</p>
                <a href="/book-now" class="btn-reserve">Start Your Journey Now</a>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
